    "title": "Bank of Korea Wants Stablecoins Written Into Forex Law as Crypto Bill and Tax Fight Come to a Head",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/bank-of-korea-crypto-bill-and-tax",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bitcoin-Kimchi-Premium-Is-Back-as-Price-Spikes-Higher-in-South-Korea.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/bank-of-korea-crypto-bill-and-tax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bank of Korea Wants Stablecoins Written Into Forex Law as Crypto Bill and Tax Fight Come to a Head</a></p>\n<p>The Bank of Korea told lawmakers it will draft a forex law amendment this year to regulate stablecoins as a means of payment, a plan that points to tighter cross-border controls rather than legal-tender status.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/bank-of-korea-crypto-bill-and-tax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bank of Korea Wants Stablecoins Written Into Forex Law as Crypto Bill and Tax Fight Come to a Head</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bitcoin-Kimchi-Premium-Is-Back-as-Price-Spikes-Higher-in-South-Korea.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/bank-of-korea-crypto-bill-and-tax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bank of Korea Wants Stablecoins Written Into Forex Law as Crypto Bill and Tax Fight Come to a Head</a></p>\n<p>The Bank of Korea told lawmakers it will draft a forex law amendment this year to regulate stablecoins as a means of payment, a plan that points to tighter cross-border controls rather than legal-tender status.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/bank-of-korea-crypto-bill-and-tax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bank of Korea Wants Stablecoins Written Into Forex Law as Crypto Bill and Tax Fight Come to a Head</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
