    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2fwLwpDPdtU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/2fwLwpDPdtU/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Parker-Lewis-Bitcoin-Will-Settle-100-of-Global-Payments-.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/parker-lewis-bitcoin-will-settle-100-of-global-payments\" rel=\"nofollow\">Parker Lewis: Bitcoin Will Settle 100% of Global Payments</a></p>\n<p>Parker Lewis argues Bitcoin will settle all global payments as $107T in debt strains the credit system, driving merchants toward zero-fee adoption.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/parker-lewis-bitcoin-will-settle-100-of-global-payments\" rel=\"nofollow\">Parker Lewis: Bitcoin Will Settle 100% of Global Payments</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
